  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Famine Early Warning Systems Network (FEWS NET) 7</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of FEWS NET 7 is to sustainably prevent food insecurity and famine. FEWS NET 7 is structured around four main pillars of activities: Pillar 1: Emergency Food Insecurity Analysis; Pillar 2: Management of a FEWS NET Learning and Data Hub (restricted to Small Business set-aside); Pillar 3: Analysis of the Dynamics of Food, Nutrition and Livelihood Security; and Pillar 4: Technology and Innovatio.</narrative>
  </description>
